{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f2a6d7a-4b1e-4e9a-9c3d-ia-service-collection",
    "name": "MyAnimaLog - IA-service",
    "description": "Colección manual del microservicio orquestador de IA (puerto 8083). Rutas, DTOs y mensajes de error leídos directamente de AiChatController, ActionsController y ConversationsController. El auth Bearer {{jwt}} se hereda de la colección; los requests que prueban 401 o endpoints públicos lo sobrescriben con noauth.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{jwt}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Encadena requests: guarda conversationId y pendingAction.id de cualquier respuesta JSON exitosa.",
          "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
          "    try {",
          "        const body = pm.response.json();",
          "        if (body && body.conversationId) {",
          "            pm.environment.set('conversationId', body.conversationId);",
          "        }",
          "        if (body && body.pendingAction && body.pendingAction.id) {",
          "            pm.environment.set('actionId', body.pendingAction.id);",
          "        }",
          "    } catch (e) {",
          "        // Respuesta sin cuerpo JSON (health, swagger, 204, etc.) - nada que guardar.",
          "    }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (user-service)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{userServiceUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{userServiceUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login real contra user-service (no vive en este repo; ajustar la ruta si cambia). Verifica 200 con { token, refreshToken, expiresIn } y que el script guarde el token en {{jwt}} automáticamente para el resto de la colección."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.token) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('jwt', body.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
